    If ``a`` is ``None``, the **beginning** of the data is used; and if ``b``
    is ``None``, it is set to the **end** of the interval.
    If ``(None, None)``, the entire time interval is used.

    .. note:: The baseline ``(a, b)`` includes both endpoints, i.e. all
