ext_order : int
    Order of external component of spherical expansion.
"""

docdict['extended_proj_maxwell'] = """
extended_proj : list
    The empty-room projection vectors used to extend the external
    SSS basis (i.e., use eSSS).

    .. versionadded:: 0.21
